Theorem 2 (Second Isomorphism Theorem / Diamond Isomorphism Theorem). Let
$G$ be a group, $H \lhd G$, and $K \leq G$. Then:
1. $H K \leq G$;
2. $H \lhd H K$;
3. $H \cap K \lhd K$;
4. $K / (H \cap K) \cong H K / H$.
